      "note": "pulse: adiabatic, no cooling term, so the times are lower bounds.  continuous: IPC-2221 external-trace chart only -- it has no via-barrel term, so the continuous number bounds the track and says nothing about the barrel that binds the pulse number.  Neither number is a measurement and neither is a thermal model of this board."
